## 1. Core Features & Power Suite Overview

TaskForge HQ has been upgraded from a standard task manager into a **gamified, cyberpunk-infused command center** tailored for high efficiency, speed, and modern Gen-Z aesthetic appeal.

### Key Milestones Completed:
- **Zero-lag keyboard workflows**: Full command palette (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd>) for searching, navigating, and toggling tools.
- **5 Comprehensive View Modes**: List, Cards, Table, Kanban Drag-and-Drop, and Analytics Command Center.
- **Generative ambient audio**: In-browser audio synthesis for focus sessions (Rain, Space, Cafe, Synthwave).
- **Automated workflows**: AI quest breakdowns, recurring task auto-respawning, and one-click data exports.
- **Fair-play gamification**: Dynamic level thresholds, multi-tier priority XP bonuses, bidirectional reversal on accidental check-offs, and streak protection.

