## 5. Cyber Focus Clock & Ambient Audio Synthesizer

Located in the top header via the **⏱️ Focus** dock:
- **Circular Progress Dial**: Visual animated countdown timer with preset buttons (`15m`, `25m Focus`, `45m Deep Work`, `60m`, `5m Break`) and quick `+5m` / `-5m` adjustment nudges.
- **Custom Duration Input**: Set any custom minute timer (1 to 240 minutes).
- **Target Lock**: Binds the timer to a specific mission title.
- **Generative Web Audio Synthesizer**: No external audio files or network requests required. Synthesizes soothing procedural audio in real time:
  - 🌧️ **Cyber Rain**: Filtered low-pass pink noise with ambient rumble.
  - 🌌 **Deep Space**: 432Hz binaural alpha wave focus drone.
  - ☕ **Neo-Tokyo Cafe**: Warm bandpass vinyl hum.
  - 🎵 **Synthwave Chill**: Procedural electronic focus chord swells.
- **Volume Controller & Auto-Pause**: Integrated slider with auto-stop when paused.

