## 6. Global Command Palette (`Ctrl + K` / `Cmd + K`)

- **Shortcut**: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd> (or <kbd>Cmd</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd> on macOS) or the **⚡ Cmd** button in the header.
- **Fuzzy Search & Filtering**: Type to search through all tasks, categories, actions, themes, and views.
- **Keyboard Navigation**: Navigate options using <kbd>↑</kbd> and <kbd>↓</kbd> arrows, press <kbd>Enter</kbd> to execute, or <kbd>Esc</kbd> to dismiss.

