## 7. Drag-and-Drop Kanban Board View

- **Tab**: Access via the **📋 Kanban** tab in the main view switcher.
- **4 Interactive Workflow Columns**:
  1. 📝 **TO-DO** (Active backlog)
  2. ⚡ **IN PROGRESS** (Active focus)
  3. 🔍 **IN REVIEW** (Pending verification)
  4. ✅ **CLEARED** (Completed)
- **HTML5 Drag-and-Drop**: Visual drop zones with instant database sync. Dropping a card onto "CLEARED" completes the mission and awards player XP.

